{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-01/1061214/block/singleImage/3253617/df/01KG54KCZ6TXHQ58ZC4D071SYN.jpg?updatedAt=1793345326\"/><figcaption>將軍澳醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>西貢發生工業意外。 今日（30日）早上10時54分，一名69歲男工於西貢蠔涌路修理一輛有挖斗的小型搬運車，修理完後試車期間挖斗翻側，壓著他的腳部，他自行報警求助。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，消防將他救出，他兩腳擦傷由救護車清醒送往將軍澳醫院治理。警方將事件列「工業意外」跟進調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:43:47.000294+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:28:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:43.810730+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:39:06.962992+00:00","content_hash":"b2974fda62fee4219ef771833f75a9e8a2880beb19a3e8f8881632480389923f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}